  "description": "OfficeViewer.Avalonia 提供支持字节绑定的 Avalonia 原生 DOCX、PPTX、XLSX 与常见 PDF 连续预览控件，支持自动释放文档资源和 NativeAOT；DOCX、PPTX、XLSX 的读取与布局设计参考 vue-office-core。OfficeViewer.Avalonia provides native Avalonia viewers for DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, and a common PDF subset with bindable document bytes, continuous scrolling, automatic resource release, and NativeAOT support; DOCX, PPTX, and XLSX reading and layout design are informed by vue-office-core.",
